---

## Architecture actuelle

```
ai-system/
  agents/     planner, coder (diff max 20 lignes), reviewer (smart skip),
              memory (FAISS+rerank), analyzer (OWASP)
  core/       orchestrator (Leader V2), config, llm (sync+async+stream),
              cache, tokens, tracer, logger, task_optimizer, auto_fix
  tools/      indexer, search, embedder, file_loader, file_selector
  api/        main (FastAPI v3), auth (JWT HS256), rate_limit (20 RPM)
  deploy/     setup.sh, deploy.sh, nginx.conf, ai-system.service
  run.py      CLI : run|fix|optimize|scan|index|serve

dashboard/
  backend/    FastAPI + PostgreSQL — /collect, /traces, /metrics, /ws
  frontend/   Next.js 14 dark — dashboard, flow graph, timeline, live feed
  docker-compose.yml
```

---

## Features — état final

### Leader (Orchestrator)
- [x] Python pur, zéro LLM direct
- [x] Routing DEV / SCAN / INDEX
- [x] Parallélisation tâches indépendantes
- [x] Sequential pour dépendances
- [x] Logging JSONL + HTTP tracer à chaque étape

### Planner
- [x] JSON structuré (id, description, target, type, depends_on)
- [x] Reçoit uniquement la query (aucun code)

### Task Graph Optimizer
- [x] Merge tâches (Jaccard ≥ 0.85 OU même target+type)
- [x] Split parallel / sequential
- [x] Stats LLM calls saved

### Memory (FAISS + Rerank)
- [x] FAISS top-30 → rerank keyword → top-5
- [x] Compression 800 chars/chunk
- [x] Budget strict 3000 tokens
- [x] Rebuild auto (mtime)
- [x] Fix Windows : serialize_index pour chemins avec accents/espaces

### Cache
- [x] SHA256(task + context), TTL 1h, fichier .cache/
- [x] Event cache_hit loggé

### Coder
- [x] Unified diff only
- [x] Max 20 changed lines enforced (tronque + tag)
- [x] Context compressé

### Reviewer
- [x] Smart skip (simple_fix, rename, comment, formatting)
- [x] Event reviewer_skip loggé avec raison
- [x] Diff in → Diff out

### Analyzer (SCAN)
- [x] OWASP subset (injection, auth, XSS, access control, config)
- [x] Cache MD5 par fichier
- [x] Analyse parallèle
- [x] Tri high→medium→low

### Auto-Fix
- [x] High severity en priorité, max 5 fixes, parallèle

### Observabilité
- [x] start, end, cache_hit, optimizer
- [x] task_split, reviewer_skip (+ raison)
- [x] scan_start, scan_end, error

### API (FastAPI v3)
- [x] POST /auth/token — JWT par project_id
- [x] POST /run, /scan, /index, /stream
- [x] GET /status, /events, /health
- [x] Rate limit 20 RPM/projet, isolation project_id

### Dashboard SaaS
- [x] Backend : /collect, /traces, /metrics, WS /ws
- [x] Frontend : KPIs, charts, FlowGraph ReactFlow, timeline, live feed
- [x] Docker Compose (postgres + backend + frontend)
- [ ] Docker Desktop non installé sur la machine — dashboard pas encore lancé

### Déploiement Hetzner
- [x] setup.sh, deploy.sh, nginx.conf, systemd, .env.example

